---

<Layout
  title="Kannada Rajyotsava Celebration | Icon School of Excellence"
  description="Celebrate the rich culture and heritage of Karnataka during the Kannada Rajyotsava event at Icon School of Excellence, Bangalore."
  keywords="Kannada Rajyotsava Bangalore, cultural events, Karnataka heritage, Icon School celebrations"
  robots="index, follow"
  canonical="https://iconschoolofexcellence.com/events/kannada"
>
  <EventsList
    event_title="Kannada Rajyotsava"
    event_sub_title="Explore the latest photos from our Hands on Activity at ISOE"
    paragraph=`On November 4th, we had the privilege of
                                celebrating Kannada Rajyotsava at Icon School of
                                Excellence. The event began with a flag hoisting
                                ceremony, followed by a special assembly that
                                highlighted the cultural richness of Karnataka.
                                Our students presented a beautiful Kannada
                                patriotic song and performed traditional dances
                                , reflecting the state’s vibrant heritage. Short
                                speeches were delivered, emphasizing the
                                significance of Kannada Rajyotsava and the
                                history of Karnataka. It was a memorable
                                occasion that fostered pride and unity within
                                our school community`
    images={images}
  />
</Layout>
